{{!
    @template customfield_picture/picture

    The stored picture of a custom field instance, as export_value() renders it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * url - the plugin file URL of the picture, unescaped
    * alt - the field name in the plain spelling (the double stash escapes it)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "url": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/31/customfield_picture/file/5/logo.png",
        "alt": "Institutional badge"
    }
}}
<img src="{{url}}" alt="{{alt}}" class="customfield_picture">
